tests/instructions/model/MixedListSpacing.md:14:1:warning:WritingInstructions.MixedListSpacing:§6: CommonMark joins the lists on both sides of this blank line into one list. If the lists are separate, put a paragraph between them. Otherwise, delete the blank line. If you delete the blank line in an ordered list, number its items in sequence.
